        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>市场分析</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n      background: #a000aa;\n    }\n    body {\n      padding: 15px 13px 13px;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.08), transparent 12%, transparent 88%, rgba(255,255,255,.05)),\n        #9d00a7;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 100%;\n      min-height: 692px;\n      padding: 23px 12px 34px;\n      background: #fff;\n      border-radius: 27px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 18px 12px;\n      color: #b3000a;\n      font-size: 26px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .content {\n      color: #444;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.78;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 0 0 4px;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      width: 370px;\n      height: 194px;\n      margin: 42px auto 14px;\n      position: relative;\n      border: 1px solid #ededed;\n      background: #fff;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .chart-title {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 5px;\n      width: 100%;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #898989;\n      font-family: SimSun, serif;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .grid {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 36px;\n      right: 14px;\n      top: 26px;\n      bottom: 37px;\n      border-left: 1px solid #dbdbdb;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #dbdbdb;\n      background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        transparent 0,\n        transparent 23px,\n        #eeeeee 24px,\n        transparent 25px\n      );\n    }\n    .bars {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 46px;\n      right: 19px;\n      bottom: 38px;\n      height: 125px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-around;\n      align-items: end;\n    }\n    .bar-group {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 20px;\n      height: 125px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: end;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .bar {\n      width: 10px;\n      background: #55a0d1;\n    }\n    .value {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: calc(var(--h) + 3px);\n      color: #4b4b4b;\n      font: 7px Arial, sans-serif;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .label {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 130px;\n      left: 5px;\n      width: 64px;\n      transform: rotate(-48deg);\n      transform-origin: left top;\n      color: #555;\n      font-family: SimSun, serif;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .axis {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 7px;\n      top: 28px;\n      color: #777;\n      font: 6px Arial, sans-serif;\n      line-height: 24px;\n      text-align: right;\n      width: 23px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>市场分析</h1>\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <p>随着年轻一代消费理念的改变，国货彩妆在“颜值”与“内涵”方面的双重提升以及社交媒体的推波助澜，国货彩妆在最适合的时机“杀”回了市场，也在越来越多元化的市场中找到了自己的一席之地。在当下的美妆领域，以“少女心”为品牌内核定义的“花知晓”正悄然崛起。95后、00后逐渐成为消费主力军，不仅出身论品牌，对国货持欢迎态度，对互联网的粘性更强，成为新国货在新媒体中更容易影响到的目标群体。</p>\n      <p>根据智研资讯发布的《2020-2026年中国化妆品行业产业运营现状及发展前景分析报告》数据显示：2022年中国美妆行业市场规模将突破5000亿元，随着人均可支配收入的不断增长，这意味着“美妆”在国内是一块受到资本追捧的大型诱人蛋糕。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <figure class=\"placeholder\" aria-label=\"消费者选择美妆产品所考虑的因素\">\n      <div class=\"chart-title\">消费者选择美妆产品所考虑的因素</div>\n      <div class=\"axis\">80%<br>70%<br>60%<br>50%<br>40%<br>30%</div>\n      <div class=\"grid\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bars\">\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:20px\"><span class=\"value\">12%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:20px\"></div><span class=\"label\">产品质量</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:23px\"><span class=\"value\">14%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:23px\"></div><span class=\"label\">价格</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:28px\"><span class=\"value\">17%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:28px\"></div><span class=\"label\">品牌知名度</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:29px\"><span class=\"value\">18%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:29px\"></div><span class=\"label\">包装</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:54px\"><span class=\"value\">34%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:54px\"></div><span class=\"label\">产品安全性</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:84px\"><span class=\"value\">53%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:84px\"></div><span class=\"label\">功效</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:87px\"><span class=\"value\">55%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:87px\"></div><span class=\"label\">性价比</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:98px\"><span class=\"value\">62%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:98px\"></div><span class=\"label\">产品成分</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:100px\"><span class=\"value\">63%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:100px\"></div><span class=\"label\">口碑</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:103px\"><span class=\"value\">65%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:103px\"></div><span class=\"label\">产品颜值</span></div>\n        <div class=\"bar-group\" style=\"--h:113px\"><span class=\"value\">71%</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:113px\"></div><span class=\"label\">其他</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </figure>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
